From: Thor <Thor@localhost.localdomain>
Date: Tue, 6 Jan 2026 17:43:13 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] [gr00t] add NVTX tag in VLM, LLM, DiT for checking Nsight

Signed-off-by: Thor <Thor@localhost.localdomain>
---
